## Update signing keys (secret - do not commit)
tools/signing/

## Key and certificate exports. These are what the update signer produces, so a stray
## export would otherwise land in the repo untracked but not ignored.
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
*.keystore
*.jks
