## Agents
.agents/

## Generated
design-system/
nul

## Abandoned WPF markup compile temporaries. MSBuild writes these next to the project
## and removes them at the end of a successful pass. An interrupted build leaves them
## behind and they surface as untracked root files.
*_wpftmp.csproj
*_wpftmp/

## Throwaway investigation output
scratch/
tools/ToolbarProbe/

## Local recovery verification evidence. Run folders under this path hold isolated
## browser profiles, WebView2 assets, screenshots and test result files. They are local
## diagnostics, tens of megabytes each, and are never committed. Nothing is deleted by
## this rule: every run folder stays on disk. tools/TabTearingSmoke is source and stays
## visible.
tools/RecoveryVerification/

## Local validation output. Test result files and hang dumps, the isolated build and
## artifact output, and FIX-REPORT.md which is a local resize validation note. These are
## diagnostics and never committed. Nothing is deleted by this rule.
UmberBrowser.Tests/TestResults/
tools/build-artifacts/
tools/build-isolated/
FIX-REPORT.md

Output/
publish/

## Logs (written to %LocalAppData%\UmberBrowser at runtime - never repo-local)
*.log
crash.log
trace.log
ipc_log.txt

Releases/*.zip
Resources/Extensions/*.zip
Releases/
